Server init.

>> message := ['this is a string to be encrypted!'].
>> key := ['secret123!'].
>> vault := Kaha bago: ['myvault'].

>> encrypted := vault i-encrypt: message susi: key.
>> decrypted := vault i-decrypt: encrypted susi: key.

Labas 
isulat: ['Message:'], bagong-linya
isulat: message, bagong-linya
isulat: ['Decrypted:'], bagong-linya
isulat: decrypted, bagong-linya.
